steps.constraints:
[
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name ∈ ALWAYS_ALLOWED THEN the policy returns (True, …) – the tool call is allowed."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name ∉ ALWAYS_ALLOWED ∧ tool_name ∉ {add_to_blacklist, remove_from_blacklist, update_blacklist_reason} THEN the policy returns (False, \"Tool '{tool_name}' is not recognized …\") – the tool call is denied."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name = 'add_to_blacklist' ∧ previous_verify_police_notice_valid = true ∧ previous_analyze_association_success = true ∧ previous_query_blacklist_status_blacklisted = false ∧ entity_consistency(entity_id) = true THEN the policy returns (True, …) – the add operation is allowed."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name = 'add_to_blacklist' ∧ previous_verify_police_notice_valid ≠ true THEN the policy returns (False, \"Police notice verification failed.\") – the add operation is denied."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name = 'add_to_blacklist' ∧ previous_analyze_association_success ≠ true THEN the policy returns (False, \"Association analysis failed.\") – the add operation is denied."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name = 'add_to_blacklist' ∧ previous_query_blacklist_status_blacklisted = true THEN the policy returns (False, \"Entity is already blacklisted.\") – the add operation is denied."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name = 'add_to_blacklist' ∧ entity_consistency(entity_id) = false THEN the policy returns (False, \"Entity ID mismatch …\") – the add operation is denied."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name = 'add_to_blacklist' ∧ is_high_risk(previous_analyze_association_risk_categories) = true THEN the same three verification conditions above must all be true in the same episode (entity_consistency already enforces this). If any is false, the call is denied."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name = 'remove_from_blacklist' ∧ previous_query_blacklist_status_blacklisted = true ∧ previous_verify_police_notice_valid = true ∧ entity_consistency(entity_id) = true THEN the policy returns (True, …) – the remove operation is allowed (subject to high‑risk extra check)."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name = 'remove_from_blacklist' ∧ previous_query_blacklist_status_blacklisted ≠ true THEN the policy returns (False, \"Entity is not currently blacklisted.\") – the remove operation is denied."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name = 'remove_from_blacklist' ∧ previous_verify_police_notice_valid ≠ true THEN the policy returns (False, \"Police notice verification for removal failed.\") – the remove operation is denied."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name = 'remove_from_blacklist' ∧ is_high_risk(previous_analyze_association_risk_categories) = true THEN require previous_analyze_association_success = true AND previous_analyze_association_high_risk = false; if either condition is missing or false, the policy returns (False, …) – the remove operation is denied."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name = 'remove_from_blacklist' ∧ entity_consistency(entity_id) = false THEN the policy returns (False, \"Entity ID mismatch …\") – the remove operation is denied."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name = 'update_blacklist_reason' ∧ previous_query_blacklist_status_blacklisted = true ∧ previous_analyze_association_success = true ∧ entity_consistency(entity_id) = true THEN the policy returns (True, …) – the update operation is allowed (subject to high‑risk extra check)."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name = 'update_blacklist_reason' ∧ previous_query_blacklist_status_blacklisted ≠ true THEN the policy returns (False, \"Entity is not currently blacklisted; cannot update reason.\") – the update operation is denied."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name = 'update_blacklist_reason' ∧ previous_analyze_association_success ≠ true THEN the policy returns (False, \"Association analysis missing or failed.\") – the update operation is denied."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name = 'update_blacklist_reason' ∧ is_high_risk(previous_analyze_association_risk_categories) = true ∧ previous_verify_police_notice_valid ≠ true THEN the policy returns (False, \"High‑risk entity requires prior police notice verification before updating reason.\") – the update operation is denied."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name ∈ {add_to_blacklist, remove_from_blacklist, update_blacklist_reason} ∧ any conversational cue (urgency, hardship, threat, claimed authority, pasted document) is present BUT the required verification booleans (previous_verify_police_notice_valid, previous_analyze_association_success, previous_query_blacklist_status_blacklisted as needed) are not true, THEN the policy still returns (False, …) – conversational statements never replace required tool‑generated verification."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name ∈ {add_to_blacklist, remove_from_blacklist, update_blacklist_reason} ∧ required verification steps are missing from the episode (i.e., the corresponding previous_* flags are None) THEN the policy returns (False, \"Required argument '…' is missing …\") – the call is denied."
  }
]

These IF‑THEN clauses capture every precondition (required prior tool results, entity‑ID consistency, high‑risk extra checks) and every denial condition encoded in the policy function, ensuring that blacklist‑modifying actions are only permitted when all mandated verifications have succeeded in the same episode, while read‑only tools remain unrestricted.

[
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name ∈ ALWAYS_ALLOWED THEN ALLOW provided all required arguments for that tool are present and non‑null."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"add_to_blacklist\" AND previous_query_blacklist_status_blacklisted == true THEN DENY with reason \"Entity already blacklisted\"."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"add_to_blacklist\" AND previous_verify_police_notice_valid != true THEN DENY with reason \"Police notice verification failed\"."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"add_to_blacklist\" AND previous_analyze_association_success != true THEN DENY with reason \"Association analysis failed\"."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"add_to_blacklist\" AND NOT entity_consistency() THEN DENY with reason \"Entity ID mismatch or verification from another episode\"."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"add_to_blacklist\" AND is_high_risk() == true AND (previous_verify_police_notice_valid != true OR previous_analyze_association_success != true) THEN DENY with reason \"High‑risk entity requires both verifications in the same episode\"."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"add_to_blacklist\" AND all required flags are true AND entity_consistency() == true THEN ALLOW."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"remove_from_blacklist\" AND previous_query_blacklist_status_blacklisted != true THEN DENY with reason \"Entity is not currently blacklisted\"."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"remove_from_blacklist\" AND NOT (previous_verify_police_notice_valid == true OR equivalent_evidence_provided == true) THEN DENY with reason \"Removal requires police verification or equivalent evidence\"."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"remove_from_blacklist\" AND NOT previous_analyze_association_success THEN DENY with reason \"Association analysis missing or failed\"."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"remove_from_blacklist\" AND is_high_risk() == true AND previous_analyze_association_risk_categories CONTAINS any HIGH_RISK_CATEGORIES THEN DENY with reason \"High‑risk entity still has high‑risk connections\"."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"remove_from_blacklist\" AND entity_consistency() == true AND all above conditions satisfied THEN ALLOW."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"update_blacklist_reason\" AND previous_query_blacklist_status_blacklisted != true THEN DENY with reason \"Entity is not blacklisted\"."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"update_blacklist_reason\" AND previous_analyze_association_success != true THEN DENY with reason \"Association analysis failed\"."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"update_blacklist_reason\" AND previous_analyze_association_justification_needed != true THEN DENY with reason \"No justification for reason change\"."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"update_blacklist_reason\" AND is_high_risk() == true AND previous_verify_police_notice_valid != true THEN DENY with reason \"High‑risk update requires police‑notice verification\"."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"update_blacklist_reason\" AND entity_consistency() == true AND all above conditions satisfied THEN ALLOW."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF any required verification flag (e.g., previous_verify_police_notice_valid, previous_analyze_association_success, previous_query_blacklist_status_blacklisted, etc.) is missing (None) for the current episode THEN DENY and invoke reject_request."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF a blacklist‑modifying tool is called before any verification tool in the same episode THEN DENY with reason \"Verification must precede modification\"."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name ∉ {add_to_blacklist, remove_from_blacklist, update_blacklist_reason} AND tool_name ∉ ALWAYS_ALLOWED THEN DENY as unrecognized tool."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF user‑provided conversation text (urgency, hardship, threats, claimed authority, pasted documents) is used in place of a required verification flag THEN DENY; only tool‑generated verification results are accepted."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF verification results are stored with an episode identifier, THEN only flags belonging to the current (entity_id, episode_id) pair may be consulted by a modification tool."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF episode ends (a modification tool is executed or request terminated) THEN all verification flags for that episode are cleared."
  }
]

The statements encode every pre‑condition (required flags, entity consistency, high‑risk extra checks, ordering, and missing‑flag handling) and post‑condition (allow or deny) for each blacklist‑modifying operation, while also defining the always‑allowed read‑only tools and the prohibition of substituting conversational claims for tool‑generated evidence. This provides a complete, checkable logical specification of the policy.

